<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks fell, two rose and eight were flat in 11.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,826.6 points, one percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.2 percent in a 24.7-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
